<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Evaluation Details</h3>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we provide a detailed breakdown of <span id="A6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">goal-reaching (R)</span> and <span id="A6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">collision (C)</span> rates on <span id="A6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DRPBench</span> for all methods.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A6.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A6.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A6.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;" colspan="5"><span id="A6.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DRPBench (R/C)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A6.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;">SE</td>
<td id="A6.T6.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;">SAO</td>
<td id="A6.T6.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;">FDO</td>
<td id="A6.T6.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:10.0pt;">GB</td>
